  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a medium saucepan, combine the almond flour, brown rice, almonds, butter, sugar, salt, cinnamon, and nutmeg. ",
    "Cook over medium heat, stirring constantly, for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the vanilla extract and egg to the saucepan and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the saucepan to the preheated oven and bake for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the saucepan from the oven and let cool for 5 minutes.",
    "Serve the Quick Norwegian Almond Flour Bake warm, garnished with additional almonds if desired."
